{"unit_id":"p2coder__dsh-task-control#card-zh","repo":"p2coder/dsh-task-control","commit":"f1da5babc880c95bdf17688942eea4a96dd4424a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-control 是面向 DSH Web 的任务控制插件，在输入区提供暂停、恢复和取消操作，也注册 /pause、/resume、/cancel 命令。安全暂停会等当前工具完成或推理到达边界；强制暂停会立即中断运行，并记录可能被打断的工具。恢复时可选择重跑或跳过中断或尚未派发的工具。设置页可配置默认暂停模式及安全暂停的推理策略，状态按会话持久保存。适合需要中止或接续长时间 DSH 对话任务的 Web 用户；无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:295-650","lib/index.js:794-856","lib/client.js:430-525"]}
{"unit_id":"p2coder__dsh-task-control#card-en","repo":"p2coder/dsh-task-control","commit":"f1da5babc880c95bdf17688942eea4a96dd4424a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-task-control adds pause, resume, and cancel controls to DSH Web. Safe pause waits for a tool or reasoning boundary; force pause interrupts immediately. Resume continues from the pause point, with a choice to rerun or skip interrupted tools. Pause settings and session state persist locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:295-650","lib/index.js:794-856","lib/client.js:430-525"]}
