{"unit_id":"p2coder__dsh-task-control#feature-pause","repo":"p2coder/dsh-task-control","commit":"f1da5babc880c95bdf17688942eea4a96dd4424a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-control 的功能「暂停任务」：输入 /pause，可附加 force 或 safe 及 stop 或 wait；默认模式可在设置页修改。强制模式立即打断运行，安全模式等工具或推理到达安全边界后暂停。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:794-840","lib/index.js:295-650"]}
